{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480","name":"Yuuzhan Vong","source":{"id":"source:reference-93079e2f7d73d480","title":"Yuuzhan Vong","revision":27415,"timestamp":"2026-07-04T13:28:37Z","sha256":"c990134cd91b330491cc67e50b7b502edaac29532dc205e60b02eac2a2721011","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=27415","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Yuuzhan%20Vong&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-93079e2f7d73d480","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Yuuzhan Vong come from the unknown reaches of space, entering the galaxy as invaders fueled by religious conviction. They have no connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", and regard mechanical technology as blasphemous. Their Starships, weapons, armor, and tools are genetically engineered lifeforms or created from the byproducts of such creatures.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After laying waste to many New Republic worlds, the invading Yuuzhan Vong are eventually overcome by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},". Peace is restored, even though some Yuuzhan Vong remain behind in isolated corners of the galaxy. In time, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," approach these few remaining Yuuzhan Vong, hoping to harness their advanced terraforming technology to restore many of the worlds ravaged during the invasion.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Surprisingly, the Yuuzhan Vong agree to help ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", but their terraforming attempts are sabotaged by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". The blame for this failure falls squarely on the Yuuzhan Vong, who are hated and feared. The Yuuzhan Vong and their Jedi accomplices are hunted down, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," falls beneath the onslaught of Imperial forces.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Yuuzhan Vong Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Although the Yuuzhan Vong became a more introspective people following their defeat at the hands of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},", they remain capable, spiritual warriors. A great many feel that the galactic community will never accept them. Years of hostility, coupled with propaganda, have painted the Yuuzhan Vong in a sinister light that cannot easily be dispelled. Still, they maintain a code of honor that is often lost on those who do not understand them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Yuuzhan Vong heroes are exceptional in many ways, not the least of which is their belief that they must evolve to survive- and that entails learning how to coexist with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," traditionally regarded as weak or impure, and letting go of their own prejudices. These rare Yuuzhan Vong see the road ahead as difficult, but worth traveling.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong are humanoids with sloped foreheads, pallid skin, and dark hair. Their skin bears ritualistic scars and tattoos that add to their sinister appearance. A typical Yuuzhan Vong male stands at 1.8 meters tall and weighs 70 kilograms, while a typical Yuuzhan Vong female stands at 1.65 meters tall and weighs 55 kilograms.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Yuuzhan Vong age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-11 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["12-17 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["18-40 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["41-60 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["61-75 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["76+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," Unknown. The Yuuzhan Vong trace their origins to a place far beyond the known galaxy. At the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Jedi Order Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Jedi_Order_Era"},", the surviving Yuuzhan Vong are exiled to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zonama Sekot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zonama_Sekot","referenceId":"reference:60b35ed2dd2d676c"},", a living planet rumored to be the seed of the original Yuuzhan Vong homeworld. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zonama Sekot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zonama_Sekot","referenceId":"reference:60b35ed2dd2d676c"}," retreats into ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," at the beginning of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith-Imperial War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith-Imperial_War"},", leaving a number of Yuuzhan Vong stranded in other remote corners of the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," The language of the Yuuzhan Vong is a halting, chilling tongue. Yuuzhan Vong rarely learn other languages, relying on bioengineered translators known as tizowyrms to translate for them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nom Anor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nom_Anor?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Dooje Brolo, Malik Carr, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yomin Carr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yomin_Carr?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Chine-kal, Nas Choka, Da'Gara, Elan. Kae Kwaad, Mezhan Kwaad, Kahlee Lah, Qurang Lah, Tsavong Lah, Ma'Shraid, Vua Rapuung, Shedao Shai, Taan, Tu Shoolb, Nem Yim.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong society is divided into castes. Members of the intendant, priest, and shaper castes are often ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"},", while members of the warrior caste are typically ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},". The worker caste is made up of members of nearly any class, though the vast majority are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," characters. Due to their lack of connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", Yuuzhan Vong can never be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Yuuzhan Vong Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Yuuzhan Vong share one of the following sets of Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Core Rulebook"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"},". Yuuzhan Vong are powerfully built, but rash and quick to pass judgment."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Yuuzhan Vong have no special modifiers due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Biotech Proficiency:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong suffer no penalties while wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Biotechnology"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Biotechnology"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Force Immunity:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong can't take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat, can't make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks, and never gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},". In addition, they are immune to any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," effect that targets their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," and aspects of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Technophobic:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong take a -5 penalty on attack rolls and skill checks made when using mechanical weapons or tools."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Familiarity:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong treat ",{"tag":"a","children":["Amphistaffs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Amphistaffs"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)"}," instead of as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Yuuzhan Vong can speak, read, and write Yuuzhan Vong."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"},". Yuuzhan Vong are powerfully built, but rash and quick to pass judgment."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Yuuzhan Vong have no special modifiers due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Biotech Proficiency:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong suffer no penalties while wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Biotechnology"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Biotechnology"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Force Immunity:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong can't take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat, can't make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks, and never gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},". In addition, they are immune to any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," effect that targets their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," and aspects of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Primitive:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong do not gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Heavy Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Heavy_Weapons)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Pistols)"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Rifles)"},", as starting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," at 1st level, even if their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class"}," normally grants them."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Familiarity:"]}," Yuuzhan Vong treat ",{"tag":"a","children":["Amphistaffs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Amphistaffs"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)"}," instead of as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Yuuzhan Vong can speak, read, and write Yuuzhan Vong."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
